# Thinking Brain Architecture Specification

## 1. Purpose

Build a modular experimental platform capable of:

- Neural and synaptic simulation
- STDP, Hebbian learning, and homeostatic regulation
- Working, episodic, and semantic memory
- Associative retrieval and consolidation
- Candidate-thought generation and selection
- Natural-language communication
- Reproducible testing and behavioral evaluation

These capabilities implement the major phases of [Building_a_Thinking_Brain__Synapses,_Memories,_and_Thoughts.xlsx](https://onedrive.live.com/personal/816689e597770cb7/_layouts/15/doc.aspx?resid=2bb13376-f660-41b6-b554-99690dae63fe&cid=816689e597770cb7&EntityRepresentationId=12f0492f-846d-42ec-b394-f5d590011b5f). [2](https://onedrive.live.com/personal/816689e597770cb7/_layouts/15/doc.aspx?resid=2bb13376-f660-41b6-b554-99690dae63fe&cid=816689e597770cb7)

## 2. System context

