### 4.5 Cognitive Orchestrator

Runs the cognitive cycle:

```text
Encode input
  -> retrieve memories
  -> update working memory
  -> simulate relevant neural populations
  -> generate thought candidates
  -> score and select
  -> formulate response
  -> record episode
  -> submit learning signal
```

### 4.6 Language Service

Converts input into grounded representations and selected thoughts into responses. It may submit memory proposals, but it cannot write directly to durable memory.

